PY## LangGraph Agentic Stock Analyzer (Colab)

This notebook builds an agentic workflow using LangGraph to:
- Collect stock, news, and social data in parallel
- Summarize and assess sentiment
- Predict intraday price bounds (first/second half)
- Produce a user-facing report

Notes:
- If `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set, the agent can use an Assistant + Tool loop to orchestrate data fetching; otherwise it falls back to fast, parallel Python fetchers.
- Works without paid APIs by using yfinance, Google News RSS, and snscrape for recent tweets.
